invalid type: string "Demerits of ICT - Introduction\nImportant Note:\n\"Not only does ICT help us as an enabler to perform day-to-day activities, it has \nbecome a close companion. However, if you use this companion in an undue manner, \nit may bring forth undesirable effects.\"\nDemerits of ICT:\n/g8E3 Addiction\n/g8E3 Health issues\n/g8E3 Inappropriate friendships\n/g8E3 Computer viruses\ncted 